        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Logs, hardwood, at forest
The volume refers to the wood including the bark. The logs have a water content (u) of 20%, a mass of 780 kg/m3 and a lower heating value of 15.0 MJ/kg.;
Synonyms: Buche, Beech, Brennholz; 
UUID: cd9360d5-2910-3b95-949e-ef4420a9f760
Includes only the splitting of residual wood with a diesel powered splitting machine
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Motormanual production with diesel powerded splitting machine
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: The assumption that Switzerland is representative for central Europe is considered in the uncertainties.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_cd9360d5-2910-3b95-949e-ef4420a9f760.xml</text>
